        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Terri Nunn, Sonya Scarlet, Virginia Macolino\n- Organizations: Berlin, Theatres des Vampires\n- Products: Information\n- Roles: singer, actress, lyricist, lead vocals\n\nFacts:\n- Terri Nunn was born on June 26, 1961.\n- Terri Nunn is an American singer and actress.\n- Sonya Scarlet was born on April 2, 1980.\n- Sonya Scarlet is the singer and lyricist of the Italian extreme gothic metal band Theatres des Vampires.\n- During the recording of the album Information, Terri Nunn had temporarily left the band Berlin to pursue an acting career.\n- During that same recording period for Information, Virginia Macolino performed the lead vocals.",
